.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH shiftpaperd 1  shiftpaper 
.SH NAME
shiftpaperd \- The shiftpaper parallax wallpaper daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBshiftpaperd\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
The shiftpaper parallax wallpaper daemon.
.PP
shiftpaperd draws the wallpaper chosen with `shiftpaper set` or `shiftpaper slideshow` on every screen, and shifts it as the cursor moves. It runs in the foreground and is usually started by systemd:
.PP
  systemctl \-\-user enable \-\-now shiftpaperd
.SH FILES
.nf
~/.config/shiftpaper/config.toml   Settings, written by shiftpaper
.fi
.SH SIGNALS
.nf
SIGHUP           Reload config.toml. shiftpaper sends this after a change.
SIGTERM, SIGINT  Exit.
.fi
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.nf
RUST_LOG   What to log to stderr. shiftpaperd=debug shows more.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
shiftpaper(1)
.PP
The docs: https://github.com/CPritch/shiftpaper/tree/main/docs
